#: ../../source/docs/modules/cameraview.rst:3 ee965bdc36194eecbbe5e88c82b85542
msgid "Camera Viewer"
msgstr "摄像头视图"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cameraview.rst:9 0820f70a0d3a4988840a0038afb84401
msgid ""
"Adds a layer to the map showing the area in view of a belly-mounted camera, "
"accounting for the current roll and pitch of the UAV. It also provides the "
"data for geotagging captured images."
msgstr "在地图上添加一层，显示腹部挂载摄像头的视野范围，同时考虑无人机当前的横滚和俯仰角。它还提供用于地理标记所拍摄图像的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cameraview.rst:13
#: d5c9f96278a545e0b4dd24ac1cb68161
msgid ""
"This module requires the cuav library (available via pypi) for integration "
"with the camera hardware:"
msgstr "该模块需要 cuav 库（可通过 PyPI 获取）以集成摄像头硬件："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cameraview.rst:20
#: 70fd9be459f548428fa01f5443111430
msgid ""
"Also see the cuav documentation `here "
"<http://canberrauav.github.io/cuav/build/html/index.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 `此处 <http://canberrauav.github.io/cuav/build/html/index.html>`_ 的 cuav "
"文档"
